data: {"id": "c163e7c43b964a9b-thinking-parallel_evidence-859", "run_id": "c163e7c43b964a9b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n1. **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-v07/workload` 仍处于 **Pending** 阶段，容器 `app` 状态为 **Waiting (ImagePullBackOff)**，重启次数为 0。Metrics 的 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 证实此状态，Reason 标签为 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n2. **镜像引用**：Pod YAML 显示镜像为 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908`，`imagePullPolicy=Always`，**未配置 `imagePullSecrets`**。\n3. **Events 核心错误**：kubelet 报错 `rpc error: code = NotFound desc = ... not found`。即：**镜像名称或 tag 在镜像仓库中不存在**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789443164079, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

